# Privacy Policy

## Introduction

This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when using the Discord bot.

## Data Collection

We do not collect any personal information unless explicitly provided by you. The bot may collect the following information:
- Discord ID
- User interactions (e.g., commands issued)

## Data Usage

The collected data is used only to improve the functionality and experience of the bot. We do not share your data with third parties, except as required by law.

## Data Retention

Data is retained for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected. You may request that your data be deleted at any time.

## Security

We implement reasonable measures to protect the data you provide, but we cannot guarantee the absolute security of any information transmitted over the internet.

## Changes to Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted in this document.

## Contact

If you have any questions about our Privacy Policy, please contact us via our Discord server.
